se 2\">SÉANCE <span class=\"text-[9px] bg-neutral-200 text-neutral-600 px-1 py-0.2 font-mono\">BIENTÔT</span></span><span class=\"font-utility-label text-utility-label uppercase tracking-widest text-[#56565F] opacity-40 cursor-not-allowed select-none flex items-center gap-1.5\" title=\"Disponible en Phase 2\">TRAVAILLER ENSEMBLE <span class=\"text-[9px] bg-neutral-200 text-neutral-600 px-1 py-0.2 font-mono\">BIENTÔT</span></span></nav></header><div class=\"min-h-screen bg-[#F6F6F8] text-[#0B0B0D] flex flex-col font-sans selection:bg-[#0B0B0D] selection:text-white\"><header class=\"w-full h-14 bg-white border-b border-[#DCDCE2] px-6 md:px-12 flex justify-between items-center sticky top-0 z-40\"><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-6\"><span class=\"font-serif text-lg tracking-tight font-normal text-[#0B0B0D]\">fashionai<span class=\"text-[#B7410E]\">.studio</span></span><span class=\"hidden md:inline-block font-mono text-[10px] tracking-widest text-[#56565F] uppercase border-l border-[#DCDCE2] pl-4\">Kit Méthode de Shooting Virtuel · V1.0</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4\"><button class=\"px-5 py-2.5 bg-[#0B0B0D] text-white font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider hover:bg-neutral-800 transition-colors\">Télécharger le kit</button></div></header><main class=\"flex-1 w-full max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-8 md:py-16 space-y-16 md:space-y-24\"><section class=\"space-y-8 pt-4\"><div class=\"text-center space-y-4 max-w-3xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"inline-block font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#56565F] border-b border-[#DCDCE2] pb-1\">MÉTHODE OFFICIELLE &amp; DIRECTIVES IA · V1.0</div><h1 class=\"font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl text-[#0B0B0D] leading-[1.08] tracking-tight\">Transformez une photo de votre vêtement en plan de mode exploitable.</h1><p class=\"font-sans text-sm md:text-base text-[#56565F] max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed\">La méthode exacte pour passer d’une simple photo smartphone à un shooting e-commerce haute couture, sans studio physique ni mannequin sur place.</p><div class=\"pt-2 flex flex-wrap justify-center items-center gap-3\"><button class=\"px-6 py-3 bg-[#0B0B0D] text-white font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider hover:bg-neutral-800 transition-colors shadow-sm\">Télécharger le kit gratuit →</button><a href=\"#preuve\" class=\"px-6 py-3 border border-[#DCDCE2] bg-white text-[#0B0B0D] font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider hover:border-[#0B0B0D] transition-colors\">Découvrir les résultats ↓</a></div></div><div class=\"relative w-full aspect-video bg-[#121214] border border-[#DCDCE2] overflow-hidden shadow-lg group\"><video src=\"/shooting-demo.mp4\" autoPlay=\"\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsInline=\"\" preload=\"metadata\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\"></video><div class=\"absolute top-3 left-3 bg-[#0B0B0D]/85 text-white font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest px-2.5 py-1 border border-white/20 backdrop-blur-xs flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#25D366] animate-pulse\"></span><span>DÉMO OFFICIELLE · SHOOTING VIRTUEL</span></div><div class=\"absolute top-3 right-3 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"hidden sm:inline bg-[#0B0B0D]/85 text-white font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest px-2 py-1 border border-white/20 backdrop-blur-xs\">1080P · 24 FPS</span></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 inset-x-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/85 via-black/40 to-transparent p-3 md:p-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-start sm:items-center gap-2 opacity-90 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\"><div class=\"font-mono text-[11px] text-white/90 space-y-0.5\"><div class=\"font-bold flex items-center gap-2\"><span>Modèle Virtuel Fatou</span><span class=\"text-white/40\">·</span><span class=\"text-[#25D366]\">Cyclorama Studio Blanc Pur</span></div><div class=\"text-[10px] text-neutral-300\">Défilé, fluidité du textile &amp; rotation multi-angles</div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 self-end sm:self-auto\"><button aria-label=\"Mettre en pause\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-white/15 hover:bg-white/25 text-white border border-white/30 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider transition-colors backdrop-blur-xs flex items-center gap-1.5\">⏸ Pause</button><button aria-label=\"Activer le son\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-white/15 hover:bg-white/25 text-white border border-white/30 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider transition-colors backdrop-blur-xs flex items-center gap-1.5\">🔇 Activer le son</button><button aria-label=\"Plein écran\" class=\"px-2.5 py-1.5 bg-white/15 hover:bg-white/25 text-white border border-white/30 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase transition-colors backdrop-blur-xs\">⛶</button></div></div></div></section><section id=\"preuve\" class=\"space-y-3\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-center font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#56565F] px-1\"><span>01 · La Preuve</span><span class=\"hidden sm:inline\">Photo originale vs Plan Maître généré · Cliquez pour agrandir</span></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-px bg-[#DCDCE2] border border-[#DCDCE2] overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"relative bg-[#EAEAEA] aspect-[3/4] group flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden cursor-pointer\"><img src=\"/sample_garment.png\" alt=\"Photo UGC du vêtement\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.02]\"/><div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 bg-[#0B0B0D] text-white font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest px-2.5 py-1\">AVANT · PHOTO SMARTPHONE BRUTE</div><div class=\"absolute bottom-3 right-3 bg-black/75 text-white font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest px-2.5 py-1 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity backdrop-blur-xs flex items-center gap-1.5 border border-white/20\"><span>🔍 Agrandir</span></div></div><div class=\"relative bg-[#121214] aspect-[3/4] group flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden cursor-pointer\"><img src=\"/Studio_template/MAIN%20FULL-BODY%20VIEW.png\" alt=\"Plan Maître Haute Définition\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.02]\"/><div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 bg-white text-[#0B0B0D] font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest px-2.5 py-1 font-bold\">APRÈS · PLAN MAÎTRE ÉDITORIAL (2:3)</div><div class=\"absolute bottom-3 right-3 bg-black/75 text-white font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest px-2.5 py-1 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity backdrop-blur-xs flex items-center gap-1.5 border border-white/20\"><span>🔍 Agrandir</span></div></div></div><div class=\"text-center font-mono text-[11px] text-[#56565F] pt-1\">Même tombé textile, même structure de matière, même colorimétrie exacte.</div></section><section class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"border-b border-[#DCDCE2] pb-3 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-end gap-3\"><div><p class=\"font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#56565F]\">02 · Galerie de Résultats Studio</p><h2 class=\"font-mono text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[#0B0B0D]\">Exemples issus du même kit (Série Multi-Angles)</h2></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] text-[#56565F] mr-1 hidden sm:inline\">Série Complète · <!-- -->7<!-- --> Vues Cohérentes</span><div class=\"inline-flex border border-[#DCDCE2] bg-white p-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase\"><button class=\"px-2.5 py-1 transition-colors bg-[#0B0B0D] text-white font-bold\">Tous (7)</button><button class=\"px-2.5 py-1 transition-colors text-[#56565F] hover:text-[#0B0B0D]\">Silhouettes (4)</button><button class=\"px-2.5 py-1 transition-colors text-[#56565F] hover:text-[#0B0B0D]\">Gros Plans &amp; Macro (3)</button></div></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-4 gap-4\"><div class=\"bg-white border border-[#DCDCE2] p-3 space-y-3 group hover:border-[#0B0B0D] transition-all cursor-pointer flex flex-col justify-between shadow-xs hover:shadow-md\"><div class=\"aspect-[3/4] bg-[#121214] overflow-hidden relative\"><img src=\"/Studio_template/MAIN%20FULL-BODY%20VIEW.png\" alt=\"Plan Maître Éditorial\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.03]\"/><div class=\"absolute top-2 left-2 bg-[#0B0B0D]/85 text-white font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-wider px-2 py-0.5 border border-white/20\">VUE 01 · MAÎTRE</div><div class=\"absolute bottom-2 right-2 bg-black/70 text-white/90 font-mono text-[8px] uppercase tracking-widest px-2 py-0.5 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity backdrop-blur-xs\">🔍 Agrandir</div></div><div class=\"px-1 space-y-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#0B0B0D]\">Plan Maître Éditorial</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[9px] text-[#56565F] bg-[#F6F6F8] px-1.5 py-0.5 border border-[#DCDCE2]\">Plein Pied (9:16)</span></div><p class=\"font-sans text-[11px] text-[#56565F] leading-tight line-clamp-2\">Silhouette complète, posture naturelle &amp; sac bordeaux</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-white border border-[#DCDCE2] p-3 space-y-3 group hover:border-[#0B0B0D] transition-all cursor-pointer flex flex-col justify-between shadow-xs hover:shadow-md\"><div class=\"aspect-[3/4] bg-[#121214] overflow-hidden relative\"><img src=\"/Studio_template/STILL%20FRONT%20VIEW.png\" alt=\"Plan Face Catalogue\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.03]\"/><div class=\"absolute top-2 left-2 bg-[#0B0B0D]/85 text-white font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-wider px-2 py-0.5 border border-white/20\">VUE 02 · FACE</div><div class=\"absolute bottom-2 right-2 bg-black/70 text-white/90 font-mono text-[8px] uppercase tracking-widest px-2 py-0.5 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity backdrop-blur-xs\">🔍 Agrandir</div></div><div class=\"px-1 space-y-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#0B0B0D]\">Plan Face Catalogue</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[9px] text-[#56565F] bg-[#F6F6F8] px-1.5 py-0.5 border border-[#DCDCE2]\">Face Studio (9:16)</span></div><p class=\"font-sans text-[11px] text-[#56565F] leading-tight line-clamp-2\">Tombé vertical, bustier asymétrique &amp; symétrie e-commerce</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-white border border-[#DCDCE2] p-3 space-y-3 group hover:border-[#0B0B0D] transition-all cursor-pointer flex flex-col justify-between shadow-xs hover:shadow-md\"><div class=\"aspect-[3/4] bg-[#121214] overflow-hidden relative\"><img src=\"/Studio_template/STILL%20PROFILE%20VIEW.png\" alt=\"Ligne de Profil 90°\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.03]\"/><div class=\"absolute top-2 left-2 bg-[#0B0B0D]/85 text-white font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-wider px-2 py-0.5 border border-white/20\">VUE 03 · PROFIL</div><div class=\"absolute bottom-2 right-2 bg-black/70 text-white/90 font-mono text-[8px] uppercase tracking-widest px-2 py-0.5 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity backdrop-blur-xs\">🔍 Agrandir</div></div><div class=\"px-1 space-y-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#0B0B0D]\">Ligne de Profil 90°</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[9px] text-[#56565F] bg-[#F6F6F8] px-1.5 py-0.5 border border-[#DCDCE2]\">Profil 90° (9:16)</span></div><p class=\"font-sans text-[11px] text-[#56565F] leading-tight line-clamp-2\">Continuité de silhouette, basque drapée et tombé pantalon</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-white border border-[#DCDCE2] p-3 space-y-3 group hover:border-[#0B0B0D] transition-all cursor-pointer flex flex-col justify-between shadow-xs hover:shadow-md\"><div class=\"aspect-[3/4] bg-[#121214] overflow-hidden relative\"><img src=\"/Studio_template/STILL%20BACK%20VIEW.png\" alt=\"Finition Dorsale 180°\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.03]\"/><div class=\"absolute top-2 left-2 bg-[#0B0B0D]/85 text-white font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-wider px-2 py-0.5 border border-white/20\">VUE 04 · DOS</div><div class=\"absolute bottom-2 right-2 bg-black/70 text-white/90 font-mono text-[8px] uppercase tracking-widest px-2 py-0.5 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity backdrop-blur-xs\">🔍 Agrandir</div></div><div class=\"px-1 space-y-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#0B0B0D]\">Finition Dorsale 180°</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[9px] text-[#56565F] bg-[#F6F6F8] px-1.5 py-0.5 border border-[#DCDCE2]\">Dos 180° (9:16)</span></div><p class=\"font-sans text-[11px] text-[#56565F] leading-tight line-clamp-2\">Bretelles croisées &amp; fermeture éclair invisible dos</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-white border border-[#DCDCE2] p-3 space-y-3 group hover:border-[#0B0B0D] transition-all cursor-pointer flex flex-col justify-between shadow-xs hover:shadow-md\"><div class=\"aspect-[3/4] bg-[#121214] overflow-hidden relative\"><img src=\"/Studio_template/BUST%20%26%20FACE%20CLOSE-UP.png\" alt=\"Gros Plan Buste &amp; Porté\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.03]\"/><div class=\"absolute top-2 left-2 bg-[#0B0B0D]/85 text-white font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-wider px-2 py-0.5 border border-white/20\">VUE 05 · BUSTE</div><div class=\"absolute bottom-2 right-2 bg-black/70 text-white/90 font-mono text-[8px] uppercase tracking-widest px-2 py-0.5 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity backdrop-blur-xs\">🔍 Agrandir</div></div><div class=\"px-1 space-y-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#0B0B0D]\">Gros Plan Buste &amp; Porté</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[9px] text-[#56565F] bg-[#F6F6F8] px-1.5 py-0.5 border border-[#DCDCE2]\">Gros Plan (1:1)</span></div><p class=\"font-sans text-[11px] text-[#56565F] leading-tight line-clamp-2\">Fidélité d&#x27;incarnation (Fatou), grain de peau &amp; découpe col</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-white border border-[#DCDCE2] p-3 space-y-3 group hover:border-[#0B0B0D] transition-all cursor-pointer flex flex-col justify-between shadow-xs hover:shadow-md\"><div class=\"aspect-[3/4] bg-[#121214] overflow-hidden relative\"><img src=\"/Studio_template/WAIST%20%26%20CONSTRUCTION%20CLOSE-UP.png\" alt=\"Détail Taille &amp; Basque\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.03]\"/><div class=\"absolute top-2 left-2 bg-[#0B0B0D]/85 text-white font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-wider px-2 py-0.5 border border-white/20\">VUE 06 · COUPE</div><div class=\"absolute bottom-2 right-2 bg-black/70 text-white/90 font-mono text-[8px] uppercase tracking-widest px-2 py-0.5 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity backdrop-blur-xs\">🔍 Agrandir</div></div><div class=\"px-1 space-y-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#0B0B0D]\">Détail Taille &amp; Basque</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[9px] text-[#56565F] bg-[#F6F6F8] px-1.5 py-0.5 border border-[#DCDCE2]\">Macro Coupe (1:1)</span></div><p class=\"font-sans text-[11px] text-[#56565F] leading-tight line-clamp-2\">Précision du pli asymétrique &amp; texture textile crêpe</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-white border border-[#DCDCE2] p-3 space-y-3 group hover:border-[#0B0B0D] transition-all cursor-pointer flex flex-col justify-between shadow-xs hover:shadow-md\"><div class=\"aspect-[3/4] bg-[#121214] overflow-hidden relative\"><img src=\"/Studio_template/SIGNATURE%20DETAIL%20MACRO.png\" alt=\"Détail Dos &amp; Corseterie\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.03]\"/><div class=\"absolute top-2 left-2 bg-[#0B0B0D]/85 text-white font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-wider px-2 py-0.5 border border-white/20\">VUE 07 · FINITION</div><div class=\"absolute bottom-2 right-2 bg-black/70 text-white/90 font-mono text-[8px] uppercase tracking-widest px-2 py-0.5 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity backdrop-blur-xs\">🔍 Agrandir</div></div><div class=\"px-1 space-y-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#0B0B0D]\">Détail Dos &amp; Corseterie</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[9px] text-[#56565F] bg-[#F6F6F8] px-1.5 py-0.5 border border-[#DCDCE2]\">Macro Matière (1:1)</span></div><p class=\"font-sans text-[11px] text-[#56565F] leading-tight line-clamp-2\">Structure dorsale, surpiqûres et maintien des bretelles</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white border border-[#DCDCE2] p-3 flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-[11px] text-[#56565F]\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"text-[#25D366]\">✓</span>Même mannequin (Fatou), même studio lumière diffuse cyclorama, même ensemble textile asymétrique.</span><span class=\"hidden md:inline text-[10px] uppercase text-[#56565F]\">Cliquez sur un visuel pour l’inspecter en haute définition</span></div></section><section class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"border-b border-[#DCDCE2] pb-2 flex justify-between items-end\"><div><p class=\"font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#56565F]\">03 · Démonstration &amp; Étapes</p><h2 class=\"font-mono text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[#0B0B0D]\">La méthode pas à pas</h2></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs text-[#56565F] mr-2\">1<!-- --> / <!-- -->4</span><button aria-label=\"Diapositive précédente\" class=\"w-8 h-8 border border-[#DCDCE2] bg-white hover:border-[#0B0B0D] flex items-center justify-center font-mono text-xs transition-colors\">←</button><button aria-label=\"Diapositive suivante\" class=\"w-8 h-8 border border-[#DCDCE2] bg-white hover:border-[#0B0B0D] flex items-center justify-center font-mono text-xs transition-colors\">→</button></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-1.5 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider\"><button class=\"py-2 px-3 text-left border transition-all bg-[#0B0B0D] text-white border-[#0B0B0D] font-bold\">01<!-- --> · <!-- -->TUTORIEL</button><button class=\"py-2 px-3 text-left border transition-all bg-white text-[#56565F] border-[#DCDCE2] hover:border-[#0B0B0D] hover:text-[#0B0B0D]\">02<!-- --> · <!-- -->ÉTAPE 1</button><button class=\"py-2 px-3 text-left border transition-all bg-white text-[#56565F] border-[#DCDCE2] hover:border-[#0B0B0D] hover:text-[#0B0B0D]\">03<!-- --> · <!-- -->ÉTAPE 2</button><button class=\"py-2 px-3 text-left border transition-all bg-white text-[#56565F] border-[#DCDCE2] hover:border-[#0B0B0D] hover:text-[#0B0B0D]\">04<!-- --> · <!-- -->ÉTAPE 3</button></div><div class=\"bg-white border border-[#DCDCE2] p-6 md:p-8 transition-all\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-center\"><div class=\"md:col-span-6 relative aspect-video bg-[#121214] border border-[#DCDCE2] overflow-hidden group flex items-center justify-center\"><img src=\"/templates/studio_blanc_reference.png\" alt=\"Le tutoriel complet en 8 minutes\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover opacity-60 group-hover:opacity-75 transition-opacity duration-500\"/><button class=\"absolute inset-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2 text-white bg-black/40 hover:bg-black/20 transition-colors\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-white text-[#0B0B0D] flex items-center justify-center shadow-md group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform\"><span class=\"font-mono text-lg pl-1\">▶</span></div><span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest bg-[#0B0B0D]/80 px-2.5 py-1 border border-white/20\">Visionner en 8 min</span></button></div><div class=\"md:col-span-6 space-y-4\"><div class=\"font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#B7410E]\">01 · DÉMONSTRATION</div><h3 class=\"font-mono text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-[#0B0B0D] leading-snug\">Le tutoriel complet en 8 minutes</h3><p class=\"font-sans text-xs md:text-sm text-[#56565F] leading-relaxed\">Visionnez le flux de travail complet : de l&#x27;import d&#x27;une photo brute à la génération du prompt maître et au rendu final.</p><div class=\"pt-2 flex items-center gap-4\"><button class=\"px-5 py-2.5 bg-[#0B0B0D] text-white font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider hover:bg-neutral-800 transition-colors\">Lancer la vidéo →</button></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"border-b border-[#DCDCE2] pb-2 flex justify-between items-end\"><div><p class=\"font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#56565F]\">04 · Choix du Modèle &amp; Outils</p><h2 class=\"font-mono text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[#0B0B0D]\">Sélectionnez votre outil pour obtenir la version adaptée</h2></div><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] text-[#56565F]\">3 Versions Disponibles</span></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4\"><div class=\"cursor-pointer p-5 border transition-all flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4 rounded-none bg-white border-[#0B0B0D] shadow-md ring-1 ring-[#0B0B0D]\"><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\"><span class=\"font-mono text-sm font-bold uppercase text-[#0B0B0D]\">Google</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[9px] uppercase px-2 py-0.5 border bg-[#0B0B0D] text-white border-[#0B0B0D]\">Sélectionné</span></div><div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] text-[#25D366] font-bold\">Gratuit / Pay-as-you-go (~0.03$/image)</div><div class=\"font-mono text-[11px] text-[#0B0B0D] font-medium\">Imagen 3 / Gemini Image / Vertex AI</div><p class=\"font-sans text-xs text-[#56565F] leading-relaxed pt-1\">Syntaxe optimisée pour Google AI Studio et Vertex AI avec conditionnement multi-images direct.</p></div><div class=\"pt-2 border-t border-[#DCDCE2] font-mono text-[10px] uppercase text-[#56565F] flex items-center justify-between\"><span>Format kit : .md</span><span class=\"text-[#0B0B0D] font-bold\">Édition <!-- -->Google<!-- --> →</span></div></div><div class=\"cursor-pointer p-5 border transition-all flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4 rounded-none bg-[#F6F6F8] border-[#DCDCE2] hover:border-[#0B0B0D] hover:bg-white\"><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\"><span class=\"font-mono text-sm font-bold uppercase text-[#0B0B0D]\">ChatGPT / OpenAI</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[9px] uppercase px-2 py-0.5 border text-[#56565F] border-[#DCDCE2]\">Choisir</span></div><div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] text-[#25D366] font-bold\">Inclus dans ChatGPT Plus (~20$/mois)</div><div class=\"font-mono text-[11px] text-[#0B0B0D] font-medium\">GPT-4o Vision &amp; DALL-E / GPT Image</div><p class=\"font-sans text-xs text-[#56565F] leading-relaxed pt-1\">Prompts conversationnels et descriptifs avec balises @source, @tenue et @perso prêtes à l&#x27;emploi.</p></div><div class=\"pt-2 border-t border-[#DCDCE2] font-mono text-[10px] uppercase text-[#56565F] flex items-center justify-between\"><span>Format kit : .md</span><span class=\"text-[#0B0B0D] font-bold\">Édition <!-- -->ChatGPT<!-- --> →</span></div></div><div class=\"cursor-pointer p-5 border transition-all flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4 rounded-none bg-[#F6F6F8] border-[#DCDCE2] hover:border-[#0B0B0D] hover:bg-white\"><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\"><span class=\"font-mono text-sm font-bold uppercase text-[#0B0B0D]\">Claude et autres</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[9px] uppercase px-2 py-0.5 border text-[#56565F] border-[#DCDCE2]\">Choisir</span></div><div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] text-[#25D366] font-bold\">Inclus Claude Pro / API ou local</div><div class=\"font-mono text-[11px] text-[#0B0B0D] font-medium\">Claude 3.7 / 3.5 Sonnet, Midjourney, Flux.1, Seedream</div><p class=\"font-sans text-xs text-[#56565F] leading-relaxed pt-1\">Directives adaptées aux modèles multimodaux Claude (Anthropic), Midjourney v6 (--cref/--sref), et générateurs Flux/Seedream.</p></div><div class=\"pt-2 border-t border-[#DCDCE2] font-mono text-[10px] uppercase text-[#56565F] flex items-center justify-between\"><span>Format kit : .md</span><span class=\"text-[#0B0B0D] font-bold\">Édition <!-- -->Claude<!-- --> →</span></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white border border-[#DCDCE2] p-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"font-mono text-xs text-[#0B0B0D]\"><span class=\"text-[#56565F]\">Version configurée :</span> <strong>Édition Google (Recommandée)</strong></div><button class=\"px-6 py-3 bg-[#0B0B0D] text-white font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider hover:bg-neutral-800 transition-colors\">Télécharger cette version (<!-- -->Google<!-- -->) →</button></div></section><section class=\"bg-[#0B0B0D] text-white p-8 md:p-12 border border-[#0B0B0D] space-y-8 shadow-xl\"><div class=\"space-y-3 max-w-2xl\"><div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#B7410E] bg-white/10 inline-block px-2.5 py-1 border border-white/10\">ACCOMPAGNEMENT SUR-MESURE &amp; PRODUCTION EN AGENCE</div><h2 class=\"font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl leading-tight\">Un shooting personnalisé pour votre marque ?</h2><p class=\"font-sans text-xs md:text-sm text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed\">Vous préférez nous confier la direction artistique complète de votre collection, avec vos propres mannequins exclusifs et sans manipuler les prompts ? Notre équipe produit vos séries prêtes à l’emploi.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 border-t border-white/15 pt-8\"><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase text-white flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"w-5 h-5 bg-white text-[#0B0B0D] flex items-center justify-center text-[10px]\">01</span>Mannequin Signature Exclusif</div><p class=\"font-sans text-xs text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed\">Création et verrouillage d’un avatar mannequin sur-mesure réservé à votre marque avec droits d’exploitation totale.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase text-white flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"w-5 h-5 bg-white text-[#0B0B0D] flex items-center justify-center text-[10px]\">02</span>Production Complète de Collection</div><p class=\"font-sans text-xs text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed\">Pack shooting de 10 à 50 tenues : Plan Maître face, profil 3/4, dos 180° et gros plans matières calibrés.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase text-white flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"w-5 h-5 bg-white text-[#0B0B0D] flex items-center justify-center text-[10px]\">03</span>Livraison Clé en Main en 48h</div><p class=\"font-sans text-xs text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed\">Visuels haute définition 4K retouchés, prêts pour vos fiches produits Shopify, lookbooks et publicités Meta/TikTok.</p></div></div><div class=\"pt-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center gap-4\"><a href=\"https://wa.me/2250757512959?text=Bonjour%20Stephen,%20je%20souhaite%20un%20shooting%20personnalis%C3%A9%20pour%20ma%20marque\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"px-8 py-4 bg-white text-[#0B0B0D] font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-neutral-200 transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2 shadow-lg cursor-pointer\"><span>Discuter de votre projet sur WhatsApp →</span></a><span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] text-neutral-400 uppercase tracking-wider\">Devis &amp; cadrage sous 24h · Échange direct avec notre DA (+225 0757512959)</span></div></section><section class=\"bg-white border border-[#DCDCE2] p-6 md:p-10 space-y-6 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-[#DCDCE2] pb-4\"><div><span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#B7410E] font-bold\">FORMATION EN LIGNE HEBDOMADAIRE · CHAQUE SAMEDI</span><h2 class=\"font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl text-[#0B0B0D] font-normal mt-1\">Une masterclass en direct chaque samedi pour maîtriser votre workflow</h2></div><div class=\"shrink-0 font-mono text-[11px] bg-[#25D366]/10 text-[#25D366] font-bold px-3 py-1 border border-[#25D366]/20\">● ATELIER OFFERT</div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 font-sans text-xs text-[#56565F] leading-relaxed\"><div class=\"space-y-1.5\"><div class=\"font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#0B0B0D] uppercase\">01 · Débloquez vos prompts</div><p>Vous venez avec vos visuels bruts ou vos difficultés de génération, nous ajustons la syntaxe et les conditionnements en direct.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5\"><div class=\"font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#0B0B0D] uppercase\">02 · Calibrage de studio</div><p>Apprenez à verrouiller l’éclairage, les textures textiles et la morphologie de votre mannequin sur toute une collection.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5\"><div class=\"font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#0B0B0D] uppercase\">03 · Q&amp;A en temps réel</div><p>Posez toutes vos questions techniques et commerciales directement à Stephen pour rentabiliser votre production IA.</p></div></div><div class=\"pt-2 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center gap-4\"><a href=\"https://wa.me/2250757512959?text=Bonjour%20Stephen,%20je%20souhaite%20m&#x27;inscrire%20%C3%A0%20la%20formation%20en%20ligne%20du%20samedi%20sur%20FashionAI\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"px-8 py-4 bg-[#25D366] hover:bg-[#1EBE5D] text-[#0B0B0D] font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-bold transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2 shadow-md cursor-pointer\"><span>Je m’inscris à la formation du samedi sur WhatsApp →</span></a><span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] text-[#56565F] uppercase tracking-wider\">Nombre de places limité chaque samedi · Inscription gratuite</span></div></section></main><footer clas